      "description": "Find your new home to buy or rent with expert real estate tools and millions of listings right at your fingertips. Seamlessly save, search, and share home listings and apartment rentals – all on the Zillow app. \n\nThe Zillow app puts essential real estate tools and experts at your fingertips, no matter where you are in your home search. Create a personalized plan, save and share homes with your partner in a shared collection, and stay organized every step of the way. Make your home search easier when you set your search filters to search for homes to buy or rent. Check your BuyAbility℠ score for an estimate of your home-buying budget based on your finances and current interest rates. \n\nFind apartments and houses on Zillow using your Zillow Home Loans Verified Pre-approval. See which homes fit your budget, connect with a real estate agent, and take the step with confidence. See more listings than ever before, all in one place, and keep your home search moving forward. Get the app to make it all possible. \n\nAccess unit-specific costs and fees upfront as you browse zillions of options for apartment rentals. Connect with a real estate agent, visit a listing, and set up 3D home tours with Sky Tours. \n\nGet the app to seamlessly browse potential new houses and apartments.\n\nZILLOW APP FEATURES:\n\nRENT OR BUY A HOUSE OR APARTMENT\n- Plan your move with Zillow. Search, plan and take your next steps all in one place.\n- Create a personalized plan, save homes in a shared collection, and stay organized every step of the way.\n- Get your home in front of serious buyers with Zillow Preview.\n- Check out neighborhood details, including restaurants, school districts and more in your home search.\n- Access the pricing and details you need to compare homes & apartments.\n- Discover personalized home recommendations, and seamlessly connect with real estate agents.\n- Tour homes based on a filtered search. Apply filters for school districts, views, pricing, pets, HOAs, and more to find the perfect match.\n- Review personal renter profiles so you can visit a house or apartments. Engage directly with potential landlords and property managers who rent homes.\n- Easier co-shopping for homes or apartments: Tag your favorite home features and share your favorites to coordinate your search with a partner or roommate.\n- Push notifications let you know when houses come to market, have a sale pending, or drop in price while you are searching for your new home to tour.\n\nHOME SEARCH TOOLS AND REAL ESTATE AGENTS\n- Check your BuyAbility℠ to learn your budget based on current mortgage rates.\n- Track your Zestimate®, the industry-leading independent home valuation tool.\n\n- Understand what a strong offer might look like with Offer Insights.\n- Home Tours with Sky Tours- See homes in 3D, and from different angles and heights on Showcase listings with SkyTour.\n- Shop with your Zillow Home Loans Verified Pre-approval so you know what homes fit your budget.\n\nTOUR NEW HOME LISTINGS & FIND APARTMENTS\n- 3D Home Tours- Picture yourself in a home and narrow down which houses to visit in person.\n- Self Home Tours- For Zillow-owned homes, with no appointment and no pressure. Stop by when it’s convenient and unlock the door with the app.\n- Check out neighborhood details, including restaurants, school districts, and more while you look for your new home.\n\nGET CONNECTED TO A REAL ESTATE AGENT\n- Access Zillow Premier Agents, local real estate experts who meet Zillow’s bar for quality customer service.\n- Customize your home tours- From home listings to apartment rentals, you can connect with a property agent and plan your tour.\n\nFind your perfect home with immersive photos, virtual home tours, and the most listings, including things you won’t find anywhere else. Get pre-approved with Zillow Home Loans, filter your home search, or take a 3D home tour - The Zillow app gives you resources and tools you won’t find anywhere else, so you can shop smarter for your next new home.",
